{"event":"script","name":"c3_09-wingman-orders","note":"U-02: launch c3_09-loadout-b; wingman orders. Mode 0: MFD group orders Alt+O/C/E/F/F/H/G/A (codes 3,4,7,5,8,2,1,0 through 0x447248 -> 0x4231a4). Esc -> display mode 1: HDD map orders per wingman (1/2/3 select, D/A/F/T/G/O/C/E = map modes 0Ah..11h, Enter = pick at the cursor (246,163), Tab = next actor, X = send). Player stationary until 1500, then full throttle toward the hostile buildings 16/17, Enter = cockpit target, Alt+A/G/A/H/F/F and Tab picks of enemies. Bounded window of 3300 frames."}
